            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "See publication for methodology details<br><br>\n\nid = unique random anesthetic identifier<br>\nlive_observed = marks if anesthetic was live observed (art_**_secs are filled)<br>\nobservation_start = start of observation (=0)<br>\nobservation_end = end of observation (minutes)<br>\ntime = time relative to observation_start<br>\nhr = heartrate<br>\nsat = saturation<br>\nbp_dia = diastolic blood pressure<br>\nbp_mean = mean blood pressure<br>\nbp_sys = systolic blood pressure<br>\nartifact_evaluation = marks if this data point was evaluated for artifacts. data before and after observation start and end, were not evaluated, but used for algoritm training.<br>\nart_bp_secs = duration of artifactual blood pressure signal noted during live observation<br>\nart_hr_secs = duration of artifactual heartrate signal noted during live observation<br>\nart_sat_secs = duration of artifactual saturation signal noted during live observation<br>\nartifact_reason = reason of artifact (only available when live observed)<br>\nart_bp_retro = retrospective evaluation for artifacts in blood pressure<br>\nart_hr_retro = retrospective evaluation for artifacts in heartrate<br>\nart_sat_retro = retrospective evaluation for artifacts in saturation"
          },
